# Measured off art/back.jpg (dashboard_extras, plate 1, manual from the
# hero, nothing lettered on it), as fractions of its width (728px): the
# colophon between 0.57 and 0.83, centred on the width; the darker band
# from 1.26 (0.896 of the height), 0.146 tall — a short band, so the
# strip is one row, the install command beside the name. No frame on
# the plate, so the screenshots start near the top of the face, two
# frames at the shots' own proportion (580x503).
